---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Accessibility">
<section class="page-head"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">About</span><h1>Accessibility</h1></div></section>
<div class="container section" style="padding-top:var(--space-6)"><div class="prose">
<p>We aim to meet WCAG 2.2 AA. Every page has a skip link, works with a keyboard, and supports 200% zoom. Status colors always come with an icon and a word. You can turn off motion with the “Reduce motion” button in the footer.</p><p>Found a problem? <a href="/contact#report">Tell us</a>.</p>
</div></div>
</Base>
